<p id="S6.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Computational resources were provided by the German AI Service Center <span id="S6.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text">WestAI</span>.</p>
</div>
</section>
</section>
