<p id="p2.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center"><span id="p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:144%;">Supplementary Material: 
<br class="ltx_break">OpenViGA: Video Generation for Automotive Driving Scenes
<br class="ltx_break">by Streamlining and Fine-Tuning Open Source Models with Public Data</span></p>
<p id="p2.2" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center"><span id="p2.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:120%;">Björn Möller    Zhengyang Li    Malte Stelzer    Thomas Graave
