<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="S3.F6.6" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure 6</span>: </span><span id="S3.F6.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Visual examples<span id="S3.F6.7.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> of transcoded (TOK+DEC) validation images for a (b) pre-trained <span id="S3.F6.7.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">VQGAN</span> and various fine-tuned versions employing (c) <math id="S3.F6.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="J^{\mathrm{total}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>J</mi><mi>total</mi></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">J^{\mathrm{total}}</annotation></semantics></math>, and (d-g) <math id="S3.F6.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="J^{\mathrm{total}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>J</mi><mi>total</mi></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">J^{\mathrm{total}}</annotation></semantics></math> with individually omitted (-<math id="S3.F6.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="J" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>J</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">J</annotation></semantics></math>) loss components corresponding to Table <a href="#S4.T2" title="Table 2 ‣ 4.2 Results and Discussion ‣ 4 Experiments and Discussion ‣ OpenViGA: Video Generation for Automotive Driving Scenesby Streamlining and Fine-Tuning Open Source Models with Public Data" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a> in the main paper. In the first row (a) original images are from <math id="S3.F6.m13" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{D}_{\mathrm{BDDimg}}^{\mathrm{val}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi><mi>BDDimg</mi><mi>val</mi></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{D}_{\mathrm{BDDimg}}^{\mathrm{val}}</annotation></semantics></math>. Best viewed digitally with zoom.
</span></span></figcaption>
</figure>
</section>
<section id="S4a" class="ltx_section">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_section"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_section">D </span>Generated Video Examples</h2>

<div id="S4a.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4a.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Fig. <a href="#S4.F7" title="Figure 7 ‣ D Generated Video Examples ‣ OpenViGA: Video Generation for Automotive Driving Scenesby Streamlining and Fine-Tuning Open Source Models with Public Data" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">7</span></a> and Fig. <a href="#S4.F8" title="Figure 8 ‣ D Generated Video Examples ‣ OpenViGA: Video Generation for Automotive Driving Scenesby Streamlining and Fine-Tuning Open Source Models with Public Data" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">8</span></a> show generated videos using OpenViGA, each generated with a different top-<math id="S4a.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>k</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k</annotation></semantics></math> parameter, corresponding to Table <a href="#S4.T5" title="Table 5 ‣ World Model ‣ 4.2 Results and Discussion ‣ 4 Experiments and Discussion ‣ OpenViGA: Video Generation for Automotive Driving Scenesby Streamlining and Fine-Tuning Open Source Models with Public Data" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a> in the main paper.</p>
</div>
<figure id="S4.F7" class="ltx_figure"><span id="S4.F7.pic1" class="ltx_picture ltx_centering" style="width:444.46pt;height:626.0pt;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" version="1.1" width="590.40" height="831.55" overflow="visible"><g transform="translate(0,831.55) scale(1,-1)"><g transform="translate(0,0)"><g transform="translate(0,831.55) scale(1,-1)"><foreignObject width="605.06" height="831.55" overflow="visible"><img src="2509.15479v1/ft_vqgan_lwm_b2036451-aa924fd1_7_overlap_2.mov.png" id="S4.F7.pic1.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_img_portrait" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:contain" width="617" height="864" alt="Refer to caption"></foreignObject></g></g><g transform="translate(17.32,814.22)"></g><g transform="translate(268.52,814.22)"></g><g transform="translate(25.99,831.55)"><g transform="scale(1,-1)"><text xml:id="S4.F7.pic1.2">Input Frames</text></g></g><g transform="translate(277.18,831.55)"><g transform="scale(1,-1)"><text xml:id="S4.F7.pic1.3">Generated Frames</text></g></g><g transform="translate(-64.96,727.6)"><g transform="scale(1,-1)"><text xml:id="S4.F7.pic1.4">top-=1</text></g><g transform="translate(0,11.69) scale(1,-1)"><foreignObject width="47.95" height="9.17" overflow="visible"><Math mode="inline" tex="k" text="k" xml:id="S4.F7.pic1.m1">
